WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.715
Are you ok?

2
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.705
Yes, it's nothing much.

3
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.857
Hmm, you don't seem yourself today.

4
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.894
If you need to talk, I'm here.

5
00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.817
It's just that this morning I got a call

6
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.954
and my mother has been
diagnosed with that illness.

7
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.969
Come here, let's sit down for a bit.

8
00:00:58.060 --> 00:00:59.807
I'm so sorry you're feeling like this,

9
00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:02.772
it must have been very
hard to receive that news.

10
00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:07.664
Yes, I can't stop thinking about
it and be here working at the same time.

11
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.557
But it makes sense that you can't, I mean,

12
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.507
carry on with your day as normal

13
00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.414
after receiving news like that.

14
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.021
You're processing a lot at the same time.

15
00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:22.287
My chest feels tight and, at the same
time, I have no energy for anything,

16
00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:24.047
I just wanted to leave.

17
00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:26.460
Easy, let's breathe for a moment.

18
00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:28.457
Take a deep breath. What do you think

19
00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.335
would help you most right now?

20
00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:36.197
Staying here a bit longer?

21
00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.698
Talking to someone?

22
00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.131
Going home early?

23
00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.277
I think today I really need to leave.

24
00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:43.477
Leave early.

25
00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:47.266
That makes sense. Shall I come
with you to talk to our manager?

26
00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:51.577
And you don't have to go
through this alone, ok?

27
00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.977
Thank you. I was really feeling lost.

28
00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:58.407
Listen, and if it keeps being very
hard for you, if it makes sense to you,

29
00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:00.177
you don't have to go through this alone.

30
00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:01.037
You can talk to someone.

31
00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:03.077
I know MC has agreements, for example,

32
00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:07.117
you can talk to mental health
professionals, for example.

33
00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.548
But for now, let's take it easy,
one step at a time, ok?

34
00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.877
Shall we talk to our manager together?

35
00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.520
Yes. And thank you for talking to me.
